@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@walletId = COLE_O_ID_DA_WALLET_CRIADA
@transactionId = COLE_O_ID_DA_TRANSACAO

### Abrir wallet — use outro playerId se executar novamente
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "0192f28f-5dc0-7d58-bdb2-814ad6a0f4a1",
  "initialBalance": {"amount": "100.00", "currency": "BRL"}
}

### Apostar — repetir com a mesma chave retorna replay
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:bet-demo
X-Correlation-Id: demonstration

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-demo",
  "playerId": "0192f28f-5dc0-7d58-bdb2-814ad6a0f4a1",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-demo",
  "gameId": "game-demo",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": {"amount": "80.00", "currency": "BRL"}
}

### Consulta
GET {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions/{{transactionId}}

### Consulta por provedor
GET {{baseUrl}}/providers/provider-a/wagering/transactions/bet-demo

### Ledger
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/ledger?limit=50

### Reconciliar
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/reconciliation

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Métricas
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
